  "description": "Form Manager core for WA.Core: metadata engine defining forms, tables, views, charts, workflows, and site-map/profile trees that drive the WA.Core low-code/form platform. PostgreSQL support added (Npgsql provider) alongside SQL Server.",
  "id": "SI.WA.FM",
